Captures: what two machines showed about the hypervisor under them
==================================================================

Each folder is what lab-capture wrote on one machine; its SOURCE.txt says
which machine, when, and what was masked. Both were captured, not typed.

laptop-wsl2   a container on Docker Desktop on a Windows 11 laptop, whose
              Linux runs in WSL 2, a Hyper-V virtual machine
qemu-virtio   a QEMU guest under emulation with a virtio network card and a
              virtio disk

lab-capture itself is /usr/local/bin/lab-capture: read it with
less /usr/local/bin/lab-capture, or run it here with
sudo lab-capture ~/captures/here.
